      "updated": 1786081218991,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "部署原则：local 保持单进程；service 已物理拆分 API/worker，并以 PostgreSQL + Redis + DBOS 共享 durable state；application DSN secret 只读挂载给 migration/API/worker，PostgreSQL 使用独立 password secret。后续顺序：tool/model gateway -> observability/event pipeline；storage service 等 repository contract 稳定后再拆。Queue DTO 保留 request_id / idempotency_key / tenant_id / run_id；source_ref、trust_level、context trace、guardrail/audit 全程关联。\n箭头语义：黑=控制流，绿=Repository/UoW 数据，橙=CanonicalEvent/payload_ref，紫虚线=未来拆分，红虚线=信任边界，线桥=交叉不连接。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontString": "13px Helvetica",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "部署原则：local 保持单进程；service 已物理拆分 API/worker，并以 PostgreSQL + Redis + DBOS 共享 durable state；application DSN secret 只读挂载给 migration/API/worker，PostgreSQL 使用独立 password secret。后续顺序：tool/model gateway -> observability/event pipeline；storage service 等 repository contract 稳定后再拆。Queue DTO 保留 request_id / idempotency_key / tenant_id / run_id；source_ref、trust_level、context trace、guardrail/audit 全程关联。\n箭头语义：黑=控制流，绿=Repository/UoW 数据，橙=CanonicalEvent/payload_ref，紫虚线=未来拆分，红虚线=信任边界，线桥=交叉不连接。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15,
      "index": "b86",
      "autoResize": true
    },
